---

## Key Findings
- K-Means on Income + Spending Score produced the clearest segments
- Income alone does NOT predict spending behavior
- High Income, Low Spender segment represents the biggest 
  untapped revenue opportunity
- Young customers spend heavily regardless of income level
- 13 customers identified as outliers requiring individual strategies

